      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} Yes. I know about the update and the old version. However, it was only from VRChat build 1606 that the fingers started to open and close depending on the angle of the wrist, as shown in the video. The same thing happens with other avatars. There was no problem during the open beta.",
