      "value": "@{5c9cb4b7210722626d82e1a0|full_name} Hmm that's interesting that you didn't observe rotation dependent finger spread until build 1606. We added the Legacy Fingers toggle specifically because users observed this back during the Input2.0 beta (see this post https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/finger-splay-on-index-controllers specifically Salbug's first reply to Laxy there). Does turning on the Legacy Fingers toggle solve the issue for you? (It would be unexpected if any change to Index controller finger behavior was added due to build 1606, however the behavior you describe is and has been the expected behavior since Input2.0)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
